[[File:Rebel_Hangar_DICE.png|thumb|250px|The ''[[Millennium Falcon]]'' in a [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] hangar on [[Tatooine]].]]
{{Quote|Pilots, return to the hangar. The exercise is complete.|[[Lieutenant]] [[Galek]], to the [[First Order TIE fighter pilot|First Order TIE pilots]]|<ref name="Live Fire">{{Resistance|Live Fire}}</ref>}}
'''Hangars''', also known as '''docking bays''' or '''landing pads''', were areas for launching, landing, repairing, and refueling vehicles. They were located on [[planet]]ary surfaces, [[space station]]s,<ref name="Episode IV">{{Film|IV}}</ref> and [[starship]]s large enough to carry smaller ships, such as [[shuttle]]s, [[freighter]]s,<ref name="UltimateSW">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref> [[blockade frigate]]s,<ref name="Lesser Evil">''[[Thrawn Ascendancy: Lesser Evil]]''</ref> and [[starfighter]]s. Some ships like [[Imperial-class Star Destroyer|''Imperial''-class Star Destroyers]] had a [[tractor beam]] that could catch rebel ships and pull them into their hangar bays.<ref name="UltimateSW" />

Some larger ships were designed to carry many other vessels. For example the [[Venator-class Star Destroyer|''Venator''-class Star Destroyer]] used by the [[Galactic Republic]] could contain numerous starships and shuttles within its hangars.<ref name="Episode III">{{Film|III}}</ref>

The [[Executor-class Star Dreadnought|''Executor''-class Star Dreadnought]] ''[[Liberty's Misrule]]'', formerly known as the ''Annihilator'', used by [[Eleodie Maracavanya]]'s [[Sovereign Latitudes of Maracavanya]] pirate faction transformed one of the dreadnought's hangar bays into an encampment that was given several names, one of which was "[[Hangartown]]."<ref name="Empire's End">''[[Aftermath: Empire's End]]''</ref>  The modified parts of the [[Galactic Empire]] [[sail barge]] ''[[Galleon]]'' had a hangar<ref name="Descent">{{Resistance|Descent (episode)}}</ref> for launching the [[skiff]]s to [[Mission to Celsor 3|hunt]] a [[jakoosk]] on the [[Water|ice]] [[moon]] [[Celsor 3]].<ref name="Hunt on Celsor 3">{{Resistance|Hunt on Celsor 3}}</ref>

